1) Design Targets & Power Budget

AC Outputs

120 V AC (x2 receptacles), target 15 A each (NEMA 5‑15R), independent breakers.

240 V AC (x1 receptacle), target 20 A (NEMA 6‑20R), dedicated breaker.


DC Output

12 V DC accessory port, up to 20–30 A peak with resettable protection.


Control & Aux

MCU/logic 5–12 V (<1 A), RPM sensor, LCD panel, servo brake actuator, relay coils, status LEDs.



> Adjust final ratings after measured load tests; up‑rate wiring if continuous duty >80% of breaker rating.




