3) Connector Strategy

AC panel: Faston 0.250″ or ring lugs on stud terminals; torque per datasheet.

DC high current: Anderson SB50 or XT60/XT90 (enclosed), keyed to avoid cross‑mate.

Low‑voltage harness: Molex Mini‑Fit Jr/JST‑VH for 5–10 A; JST‑XH for sensors.

Serviceability: Each sub‑assembly (control panel, brake module, LCD, sensor pod) is quick‑disconnect.



