4) Harness Topology (Star Ground & Segregation)

Star ground to a single bonded chassis point (M6 stud with serrated washers; conductive coating or scraped paint).

Segregate: AC power left side; DC power right side; signal in center tray, crossing power at 90° only.

Add ferrite beads (clip‑on) on LCD and RPM lines near the core.


[AC Gen/Inv]──(Main AC Bus 10 AWG)──>[Breakers]->(120V R1)  
                                   └─>[Breakers]->(120V R2)  
                                   └─>[Breaker]->(240V R)   

[12V Source]->(Main 12V Fuse)->[DC Bus]->(LCD, MCU, Sensors, Servo, 12V Port)
                                  |                         |
                                  └──(Latching Relay Coil)  └──(Resettable 12V Port Breaker)

All returns -> Star Ground (PE) -> Chassis


