7) Detailed Harness Breakouts

7.1 AC Branch Harness

Main AC bus (10 AWG) from alternator/inverter output to 3‑pole breaker bank.

Branches:

120 V R1: 14 AWG hot/neutral/ground to NEMA 5‑15R; breaker 15 A.

120 V R2: 14 AWG as above; breaker 15 A.

240 V R: 12 AWG L1/L2/PE to NEMA 6‑20R; breaker 20 A.



7.2 DC & Logic Harness

Battery/12 V source → ANL 50 A → DC bus bar (covered).

Branches:

12 V Port: 10–12 AWG → resettable 30 A breaker → socket.

Servo Actuator: 16 AWG pair + shield → PWM driver.

MCU/LCD/Sensors: 20–22 AWG twisted; 5 V reg local; ground to star.

Latching Relay Coil: 18–20 AWG via E‑Stop loop + MCU OK.



7.3 Sensor Pod

RPM: Hall sensor + magnet flag on flywheel; twisted 22 AWG; pull‑up at MCU.

Temp (core, bearings): NTC or digital (1‑Wire) on shielded pairs.

V/Hz: Divider + isolated front‑end for AC measurement; respect creepage/clearance.



