9) Master OFF / Shutdown Sequence

1. Toggle OFF or E‑Stop pressed.


2. MCU asserts BRAKE_MAX output → servo to full brake (or spring returns).


3. Latching relay coil drops → excitation/drive de‑energized.


4. LCD shows SHUTDOWN and logs timestamp/RPM.


5. Manual RESET required to re‑arm (fault‑tolerant).




