10) Test & Commissioning Checklist

Continuity/Polarity: Verify all harnesses; ring‑out to a netlist.

Insulation: 500 V megger on AC runs (disconnect electronics).

Ground bond: <0.1 Ω star point to panel grounds.

RPM sensor: Validate pulse train; noise <50 mVpp at MCU input.

Brake servo: Command sweep 0–100%; confirm stops, current draw, temp rise.

E‑Stop: Trip test: drive drops <20 ms; servo hits brake within spec.

Thermals: 30‑min run at 75% load; IR scan of bus, breakers, connectors (<30 °C over ambient preferred).



